    "text": "## Review and decide on solution design\n\nSD: Synthetic saved filter\n\n- Proposal: Reuse the existing user-owned filter store.\n\nDraft the task and test plan; implementation remains blocked.\n\nReply “Read document” to read the complete presented version in chat. You can then approve, request changes with a comment, or decline.\n\nTo approve, reply exactly with `Approval: SD`; otherwise request revision or decline.\n\n<details><summary>Details and evidence</summary>\n\n- Solution: Reuse the existing user-owned filter store.\n- Ownership: Existing filter service retains ownership; the approved PRD remains product authority.\n- Design decisions: SDD-001: Reuse the existing filter service; rationale: retain user ownership; consequence: no shared filters.\n\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Version and sources</summary>\n\nRun: `native-en-text` · Solution design · Revision: `2014827b-fc28-40f0-a045-9f2dae10aee4`\n\nSHA-256: `sha256:be66c15cda6eec56dadb4df4dbd9fe909a399304bf6f6910016d7962dcaa2cdf`\n\n</details>",
